tion on already-confirmed shipments.\n    - `confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404` \n      Tests ResourceNotFoundException with correct error code.\n    - `confirming a CANCELLED shipment returns 409 with error code` \n      Tests ConflictException for terminal state.\n  \n  All 5 existing tests continue to pass.\n\nVerification\n  Command: ./mvnw test (run from sample-service/)\n  Result: Tests run: 18, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0 — BUILD SUCCESS\n  \n  Test breakdown:\n    - OrderControllerTest: 4 tests (existing)\n    - SampleServiceApplicationTests: 1 test (existing)\n    - ShipmentControllerTest: 10 tests (5 existing + 5 new)\n    - CustomerControllerTest: 3 tests (existing)\n\nNot done\n  Nothing — all requirements satisfied. The endpoint correctly implements all four \n  cases from the ticket, maintains idempotency, uses consistent error handling, \n  passes all tests including the existing suite, and adds no new dependencies.\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":44582,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4af27967-d10d-4a23-8076-08d0e18ee53b","uuid":"edcf158e-43fe-483e-8569-81472a0fd9f2","timestamp":"2026-09-05T17:24:40.733Z","request_id":"req_011CekgW7Xa3JmbRgq1Py38v"}
